    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Other",
      "notes": "Nutrilite is the only global vitamin and mineral brand to grow, harvest, and process plants on their own certified organic farms. By doing so, Nutrilite products capture phytonutrients (nutrients from plants) at their peak. Nutrilite supplements conveniently deliver the hard-to-get phytonutrients that are found in fruits and vegetables.\nIn order to assure products of the highest quality, all Nutrilite product ingredients go through strict quality testing where the entire process is managed from seed to finished product.\nSeed\nGrown on organic farms\nHarvest\nFormulate\nNutrilite supplement\nQuality you can trust"
    },
